# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Peter K. Eastman et al. (2023). OpenMM 8: Molecular Dynamics Simulation with Machine Learning Potentials.
#   The Journal of Physical Chemistry B. doi:10.1021/acs.jpcb.3c06662  arXiv:2310.03121v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2310.03121v2 (sha256 fc8df7d920fa0274...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
