#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/eastman2023openmm.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the ML/MM speed benchmark of ANI-2x (TorchANI vs
# NNPOps, ensemble vs single member) for a 53-atom ligand bound to CDK8
# (Table 3), and the TorchMD-NET equivariant transformer trained on
# revPBE-D3 AIMD/AI-PIMD data of the GFP chromophore in water, with its
# test force RMSE and per-evaluation time. OpenMM software features,
# classical force-field speeds and RDF/dihedral comparisons are not
# encoded.

